176        │                            ; sent back to microblaze using the streaming FIFO.
           │                            ;
176        │                            ; We then wait for take_event to go LOW. We then go back and
176        │                            ; sit in tight loop waiting for next event!
           │                            ;
176        │                            ; led[1] is lit when we are actually in the get_event subroutine
176        │                            ; led[1] is also the busy bit i.e we are in get_event!
           │                            ;
176        │                            ; For time being let’s turn led[0] on whenever take_event is low
176        │                            ; i.e. we are just waiting for an event to come along
